    stem: "‘Most eurozone countries with large deficits are using VAT to generate revenue.’ (Irish Tax Institute, The Irish Times, November 2011)",
    questionText: "Discuss the economic advantages and disadvantages for the Government of increasing VAT rates instead of income tax rates in its most recent budget.",
