    stem: "In his 1958 study, “Economic Development” T. K. Whitaker urged the Irish Government to stop sheltering ‘behind a protectionist blockade’ and to accept instead the challenge of free trade.",
    questionText: "Discuss the economic arguments for and against a government introducing trade protectionist measures to protect ‘infant industries’.",
