    stem: "‘Motor insurance providers in Ireland targeted in anti‐cartel inquiry.’ (Source: The Irish Times, July 2017)",
    questionText: "Suggest two measures the government could consider to discourage anti‐competitive practices in industry. Explain your answer.",
