    stem: "Technology retailers mislead shoppers with Black Friday ‘deals’. A survey of ‘before and after’ pricing shows that many products are not discounted as claimed.",
    questionText: "Explain why misinformation to consumers by technology retailers represents a market failure in this industry.",
