    section: "B", questionRef: "2023 HL Q12(a)(i)",
    stem: "If a consumer wishes to purchase milk in the Irish market, they are currently faced with an abundance of choice from low‐fat milk to super milk to lactose free milk. In the past this market was closer to a model of perfect competition.",
