    id: "econ-2023-hl-q13-b-ii-multiplier", topicId: "economics-3-0", conceptId: "the-multiplier-in-an-open-economy",
    section: "B", questionRef: "2023 HL Q13(b)(ii)",
    stem: "Use the information in the table below, to answer the questions that follow: Marginal Propensity to Consume (MPC) 0.7 Marginal Propensity to Import (MPM) 0.2 Current equilibrium level of National Income €500m Level of National Income that would give full employment €750m",
