    section: "A", questionRef: "2024 HL Section A Q10(a)(ii)",
    stem: "The data below has been adapted from Ireland’s National Accounts for 2023.",
    questionText: "Given that Gross Domestic Product (GDP) at Current Market Prices (CMP) was €430bn, use the information above to calculate part (ii). Part (i) has been completed for you. State the relationship and show all your workings.",
