          "alt": "The marking scheme's completed national accounts ladder, a two-column table headed Relationships / Workings and Answer in billions of euro, with a downward arrow at the left. Gross National Product at Current Market Prices is 325 billion euro; plus EU subsidies of 2 billion, underlined, giving 327 billion; minus EU taxes of 0.5 billion, underlined, giving 326.5 billion. The final row reads equals Gross National Income at Current Market Prices, with the answer 326.5 billion euro.",
