    section: "B", questionRef: "2024 HL Q12(b)(ii)",
    questionText: "The table below shows a country’s composite price index for the following categories of expenditure: food; transport; and other items. Use the information in the table below to calculate the price index for the current year. The base value is 100. Show your workings.",
