    id: "econ-2024-hl-q14-c-iii", topicId: "economics-3-4", conceptId: "why-neobanks-grew-in-ireland",
    section: "B", questionRef: "2024 HL Q14(c)(iii)",
    stem: "The number of people using the services offered by Neobanks/Challenger banks such as Revolut and N26 has grown rapidly in Ireland in recent years.",
    questionText: "Outline two reasons why so many Irish people have adopted a digital-only bank account such as Revolut.",
